{"path":"numeric/valarray/sum","title":"std::valarray<T>::sum","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::valarray&lt;T&gt;::</span>sum","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/sum","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Computes the sum of the elements.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">T sum<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Computes the sum of the elements. \n</p><p>The function can be used only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span></span></code> is defined for type <code>T</code>. If the <code>std::valarray</code> is empty, the behavior is undefined. The order in which the elements are processed by this function is unspecified.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The sum of the elements.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;valarray&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\"><span class=\"kw1481\">std::<span class=\"me2\">valarray</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> a <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">9</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> a.<span class=\"me1\">sum</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>55</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/apply\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>apply</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies a function to every element of a valarray <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/accumulate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>accumulate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sums up or folds a range of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/valarray","title":"std::valarray"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::valarray<T>::sum","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Computes the sum of the elements."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The sum of the elements."},{"label":"Example"},{"l